Multi-Agent Workflow Optimization - Validation Note
====================================================

This optimization addresses the multi-agent checkout pipeline by:

1. WORKLOAD REDISTRIBUTION: Tasks are reassigned based on agent capabilities.
   - db-agent handles query-tuning and cache-review (cost: 7)
   - app-agent takes async-audit, the highest priority task (cost: 6)
   - frontend-agent workload reduced to render-optimization only (cost: 4)

2. ERROR MITIGATION: Frontend-agent had 2 errors in baseline. Reducing its
   workload from multiple tasks to a single task should lower error exposure.
   Target error rate of 1 is achievable with this allocation.

3. PERFORMANCE TARGETS:
